{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, mice have pointed their whiskers to the night sky and marveled at \u201cThe Big Cheese\u201d. Emulate your human predecessors. Harness the power of explosions to propel yourself skyward and claim the biggest cheese, the Moon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the Cheese, because you can never have enough cheddar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/0fef7ef7ed41cadfb172bc6be1877e28.poster.avif?t=1755289741\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/0fef7ef7ed41cadfb172bc6be1877e28.webm?t=1755289741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/0fef7ef7ed41cadfb172bc6be1877e28.mp4?t=1755289741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use explosive innovation to propel yourself up and beyond. Master the precise art of The Bomb\u2122 to reach new heights as you work your way to the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 1: Place The Bomb\u2122 &amp; place yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 2: Detonate The Bomb\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 3: Be somewhere else, ideally higher than Step 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on moderately modern potatoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth, explode into greatness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Message from Your CEO:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m your CEO and it\u2019s <i>grate</i> to see all of you here as we take this important opportunity to focus on the <i>whey</i> forward. As many of you know, last quarter wasn\u2019t <i>cheesygoing</i>. It\u2019s fine to <i>brie</i> a little <i>bleu</i> after the latest earnings report. Yes, a <i>string</i> of bad investments aged like <i>milk</i>, but I believe in our <i>culture</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a <i>quark</i> of fate, we found a <i>muenster</i> of a cheese stash, right above our noses! This quarter we\u2019re shooting for the moon! Literally. The moon is, in fact, made of cheese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I, your Chief Explosives Officer, will <i>dairy</i> to go where no rodent has gone before! We\u2019re going to blow up the Moon and collect every last piece. As such, the company now aligns under the new \u201cSeize the Cheese\u201d initiative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S<i>wiss</i> you all the best,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CEO</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778900?t=1755289741","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3778900?t=1755289741","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/90047bad9852d57026735d2d45d3eb9587caadb8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755289741","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/90047bad9852d57026735d2d45d3eb9587caadb8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755289741","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For centuries, mice have pointed their whiskers to the night sky and marveled at \u201cThe Big Cheese\u201d. Emulate your human predecessors. Harness the power of explosions to propel yourself skyward and claim the biggest cheese, the Moon. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seize the Cheese, because you can never have enough cheddar!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/0fef7ef7ed41cadfb172bc6be1877e28.poster.avif?t=1755289741\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/0fef7ef7ed41cadfb172bc6be1877e28.webm?t=1755289741\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/extras/0fef7ef7ed41cadfb172bc6be1877e28.mp4?t=1755289741\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use explosive innovation to propel yourself up and beyond. Master the precise art of The Bomb\u2122 to reach new heights as you work your way to the moon.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 1: Place The Bomb\u2122 &amp; place yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 2: Detonate The Bomb\u2122.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step 3: Be somewhere else, ideally higher than Step 1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sharp pixel art.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight physics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Runs on moderately modern potatoes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go forth, explode into greatness.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Message from Your CEO:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I\u2019m your CEO and it\u2019s <i>grate</i> to see all of you here as we take this important opportunity to focus on the <i>whey</i> forward. As many of you know, last quarter wasn\u2019t <i>cheesygoing</i>. It\u2019s fine to <i>brie</i> a little <i>bleu</i> after the latest earnings report. Yes, a <i>string</i> of bad investments aged like <i>milk</i>, but I believe in our <i>culture</i>!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By a <i>quark</i> of fate, we found a <i>muenster</i> of a cheese stash, right above our noses! This quarter we\u2019re shooting for the moon! Literally. The moon is, in fact, made of cheese.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I, your Chief Explosives Officer, will <i>dairy</i> to go where no rodent has gone before! We\u2019re going to blow up the Moon and collect every last piece. As such, the company now aligns under the new \u201cSeize the Cheese\u201d initiative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >S<i>wiss</i> you all the best,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >CEO</p>","developers":["Alimonda"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3778900/39228200bb65b5e9472e1756b314ea05403d90cf/header.jpg?t=1755289741","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"name":"Seize the Cheese","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64 bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 2.4 GhZ<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</stron